  "id": "levels-of-consciousness",
  "term": "levels of consciousness",
  "definition": "In this model, levels of consciousness are distinct degrees of human awareness or experience within a broader bio-psycho-social-spiritual-ecological framework. They are described as being shaped by moral development and a person’s locus of power, and as increasing alongside emotional literacy.",
